    m_Localized: +{0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035102
    m_Localized: "{0} \u2192 {1}: {2} damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035103
    m_Localized: "{0} \u2192 {1}: {2} damage ({3})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035104
    m_Localized: '{0} falls.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035105
    m_Localized: '{0} gives {1} a mercy kill. They rest and will not rise.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035106
    m_Localized: '{0} is slain. Felled by a minion, they will not rise.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035107
    m_Localized: '{0} is slain. Fallen in the light, they will not rise.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035108
    m_Localized: '{0} falls. They will rise as a spawn next enemy phase!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035109
    m_Localized: The full moon rises!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035110
    m_Localized: Moonlight opens the coffin. {0} awakens!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035111
    m_Localized: The Coffin Opens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035112
    m_Localized: '{0} rises as a vampire spawn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035113
    m_Localized: The full moon is up. With no one in reach, {0} advances, starving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035114
    m_Localized: The full moon approaches. Next enemy turn, {0} will hunt {1}. Move
      them out of range or into the light, or mercy kill them, and the drain fails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035115
    m_Localized: Full Moon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035116
    m_Localized: Under the full moon, {0} devours {1}!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035117
    m_Localized: Drain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035118
    m_Localized: The moon sets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035119
    m_Localized: the target is already gone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035120
    m_Localized: '{0} stands in the light'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035121
    m_Localized: '{0} is out of reach'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035122
    m_Localized: The full moon rises, but {0}. The drain fails. {1} lunges, starving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035123
    m_Localized: Drain Failed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035124
    m_Localized: "{0}'s pike wall \u2192 {1}: 1 damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035125
    m_Localized: '{0}: Tap an empty hex in the deploy zone to place it. Drag placed
      units to move or swap them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035126
    m_Localized: The enemy is acting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035127
    m_Localized: The battle is over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035128
    m_Localized: Tap an ally to select it. Tap an enemy or a corpse to see its details
      and threat range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035129
    m_Localized: Tap an ally in a white dashed ring to mercy kill it. Tap elsewhere
      to cancel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035130
    m_Localized: This unit has finished acting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035131
    m_Localized: Move to a bright hex. Tap an enemy on a red hex to attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035132
    m_Localized: Tap an enemy on a red hex to attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035133
    m_Localized: Full Moon Next Turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035134
    m_Localized: "Full Moon \xB7 Starving"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035135
    m_Localized: "Target \xB7 Safe for Now"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035136
    m_Localized: Full Moon Target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035137
    m_Localized: Win within {0} turns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035138
    m_Localized: Allow no full-moon drain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035139
    m_Localized: Win after defeating every skeleton
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035140
    m_Localized: '{1} fell on turn {0}.'
